    "notes": {
        "687e8e3c-cc59-4144-91f5-34e952097510": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 1100,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 300,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Manual steps\n\nThese events cannot be provoked by the connector. The account must be a **site administrator**. After the flow starts, within 15 minutes:\n\n1. Publish a new workbook to the site (Tableau Desktop or web authoring > Save As).\n2. Change that workbook (e.g. rename it or republish it).\n3. Publish a new data source, then change it (rename or republish).\n4. Make an extract refresh fail, e.g. refresh an extract whose database credentials are wrong."
        }
    }
